Be in the running to win one of 2 x FREE double passes to the Grace Barbe, _The Afro Sound of Seychelles_ at Nambour Civic Centre, Sunshine Coast show on September 9th! All you have to do is LIKE and COMMENT on our Facebook page post [here](https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ?fref=ts). More details on the event can be found [here](http://www.scvenuesandevents.com.au/nambour-civic-centre/events/grace-barbe "Grace Barbe at Nambour Civic Centre"). [![gracebarbeeventimage](/media/2014/07/gracebarbeeventimage-1.jpg)](/media/2014/07/gracebarbeeventimage-1.jpg) What have you got to lose!? Good Luck :)
